# Too little memory (roadmap memory.md M2, D4): a 320 KB machine, whose
# memory for programs below 1 MB is under UMEM_LEAST once the image is
# loaded. The kernel says so and stops, where it once handed out what was
# not there or left the root unable to build (E3).
memory: 320K 0K
---
rx286, test build
rx286 PANIC: too little memory for programs below 1 MB (UMEM_LEAST)
